         musicD lyrics [DIR]               upgrade lyrics of songs you already have (word-level if possible)
Options: -f mp3|m4a   -j N   -p/--pick   --no-lyrics   --no-itunes
         --country XX   --cookies-from-browser NAME
Env:     MUSICD_DIR (default ~/Music)   MUSICD_COUNTRY (iTunes storefront, default US)
